tests: carry LLVM upstream's verifier workarounds on the two pre-RA-sched=linearize tests

Symptom (our feed, translator built against LLVM trunk 24.0.0_r602112): two of the 1156 lit
tests abort with
  *** Bad machine code: Using an undefined physical register ***
  - instruction: JCC_1 %bb.2, 5, implicit $eflags
  LLVM ERROR: Found 1 machine code errors.

Root cause is NOT the translator and NOT a new LLVM regression to "wait for": these two files
are copies of LLVM's own DebugInfo tests, and upstream's copy carries a FIXME saying exactly
this:
  ; FIXME: Fix machine verifier issues and remove -verify-machineinstrs=0 and
  ; -disable-mir-output-verify. PR39452.
i.e. at the -stop-before=finalize-isel cut point X86 has not yet finalised flag defs/uses, so
the machine-instruction verifier is expected to complain, and upstream disables it *for this
pipeline stage only*. The translator's copies simply lost those two flags when the files were
forked, so the same command line now dies in the verifier instead of reaching FileCheck.

This does not skip anything: the tests' real assertions (DBG_VALUE placement for "x" in
bb.2.for.body, and the EIS-option debug values) still run. Verified locally against the
installed trunk build - without the flags llc aborts; with them, FileCheck passes for both.
diff --git a/test/DebugInfo/Generic/debug-info-eis-option.ll b/test/DebugInfo/Generic/debug-info-eis-option.ll
index 2338792..ec3d7f3 100644
--- a/test/DebugInfo/Generic/debug-info-eis-option.ll
+++ b/test/DebugInfo/Generic/debug-info-eis-option.ll
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 ; RUN: llvm-spirv %t.bc -o %t.spv --spirv-debug-info-version=legacy
 ; RUN: llvm-spirv -r %t.spv -o - | llvm-dis -o %t.ll
 
-; RUN: llc -mtriple=%triple -stop-before=finalize-isel -pre-RA-sched=linearize < %t.ll -experimental-debug-variable-locations=false | FileCheck %s
+; RUN: llc -mtriple=%triple -stop-before=finalize-isel -pre-RA-sched=linearize -verify-machineinstrs=0 -disable-mir-output-verify < %t.ll -experimental-debug-variable-locations=false | FileCheck %s
 
 ; RUN: llvm-spirv %t.spv -to-text -o - | FileCheck --check-prefix CHECK-SPIRV %s
 
diff --git a/test/DebugInfo/Generic/linear-dbg-value.ll b/test/DebugInfo/Generic/linear-dbg-value.ll
index 9b32854..4e6a90a 100644
--- a/test/DebugInfo/Generic/linear-dbg-value.ll
+++ b/test/DebugInfo/Generic/linear-dbg-value.ll
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 ; RUN: llvm-spirv %t.bc -o %t.spv
 ; RUN: llvm-spirv -r %t.spv -o - | llvm-dis -o %t.ll
 
-; RUN: llc -mtriple=%triple -stop-before=finalize-isel -pre-RA-sched=linearize < %t.ll -experimental-debug-variable-locations=false | FileCheck %s
+; RUN: llc -mtriple=%triple -stop-before=finalize-isel -pre-RA-sched=linearize -verify-machineinstrs=0 -disable-mir-output-verify < %t.ll -experimental-debug-variable-locations=false | FileCheck %s
 
 ; RUN: llvm-spirv %t.spv -to-text -o - | FileCheck --check-prefix CHECK-SPIRV %s
 
